            <h1>Systemic Therapy and Counseling</h1>
            <p class="rd-lead">Systemic therapy and counseling is for people who want to bring about lasting change. When you are facing stressful situations, inner or outer conflicts or recurring problems, we can develop new ways of dealing with them. Your strengths and abilities can be activated and your sphere of influence widened. New room to move can emerge on the cognitive, emotional and social level.</p>
            <p class="hero-note"><strong>Important:</strong> My services are neither psychotherapy nor medical treatment. In acute crises, please turn to medical or psychotherapeutic services: <a href="#faq-krise">Where to turn in acute crises</a>.</p>
            <nav class="page-jump" aria-label="On this page"><span class="page-jump-label">On this page</span><div class="page-jump-list"><a href="#arbeitsverstaendnis">Systemic</a><a href="#arbeitsweise">Approach</a><a href="#angebote">Services</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a href="#kontakt">Contact</a></div></nav>
